  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 23 Question 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why was it good - and not bad - that Jesus left the earth?
  answers:
  - Because they didn't like Him anyway
  - Because He sent the Holy Spirit
  - Because He got tired
  - Because He didn't like them anyway
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: Jesus lived on earth, as a man and could only be with a small
    group of His followers at any time.  But when He returned to heaven, He send
    the Holy Spirit, who lives inside every single believer, no matter where they
    are in the world.
